<title>UK: SBAB sets 16.0 billion yen March 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>SBAB sets 16.0 billion yen March 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Wako International (Europe) Ltd and IBJ International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDISH NATIONAL HOUSING FINANCE (SBAB)</p>
<p> AMT    16.0 BLN YEN  COUPON    *6.0 PCT   MATURITY    28.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    26.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.60	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*REDEMPTION IN A$</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 100-1M    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
